  (text "I2C BUS" (at 38 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101"))
  (text "PN5321 MINI address: 7-bit 0x24. Module provides onboard I2C pull-ups." (at 38 180 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102"))
  (text "Adafruit 3886 default AD0 is pulled low: 7-bit address 0x68. Breakout includes 10k I2C pull-ups and level shifting." (at 38 185 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000103"))
  (text "Do not add carrier pull-ups until combined module pull-up resistance is checked." (at 38 190 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104"))
  (text "POWER HOLD — P_3V3_PERIPH_HOLD has no source in this schematic. Do not energise module VIN yet." (at 38 207 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000105"))
  (text "P15-16 (3V3 LDO output) and P15-18 (VBUS/USB 5V shared net) are isolated HOLD nets; neither is connected to raw LiPo." (at 38 212 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000106"))
  (text "P15-6 / GPIO10 is intentionally NC: the PN5321 MINI 7-pin I2C host interface does not expose IRQ. Polling is required." (at 38 244 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000107"))
  (text "PN5321 MINI SCK and MISO are NC in I2C mode. Route host wiring by the module's printed signal names, NOT guessed cable conductor order." (at 38 249 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000108"))
  (text "Adafruit 3Vo is a regulator output and is intentionally NC. Adafruit 3886 uses VIN as its supply input." (at 38 254 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000109"))
  (text "Battery ADC, charge status, tether protection and audio driver are assigned logical MCU nets but not wired to incomplete power/actuator circuits yet." (at 38 259 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "8fa00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000110"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
