  (text "NFC RESET STAGE: GPIO11 drives Q1 through R1; Q1 sinks PN532 RST. High GPIO11 asserts reset (logic inversion)." (at 36 223 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "8fb00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000046"))
  (text "Q1 Nexperia MMBT3904 SOT-23: pin 1=B, pin 2=E, pin 3=C. R1=10k base series; R2=100k base-emitter pull-down; R3=10k reset pull-up." (at 36 228 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "8fb00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000047"))
  (text "R3 pulls up only to P_3V3_PERIPH_HOLD. This rail remains unsourced until the complete power architecture is released." (at 36 233 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "8fb00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000048"))
  (text "R4/R5 are optional 4.7k I2C pull-ups, DNP by default. PN532 manual describes onboard pull-ups while other module-revision notes conflict; inspect actual module and calculate combined bus resistance before population." (at 36 238 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "8fb00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000049"))
